3({x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-10x+8) \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}-30x+24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}-30x+24.$" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304720 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304721 13194139534708 true] [17592186304720 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304722 13194139534708 true] [17592186304720 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534708 true] [17592186304720 1041 "field-1" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304720 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304721 13194139534708 true] [17592186304720 1110 #uuid "594494cb-8751-5c20-8e29-9125c06203c8" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304721 1034 "3" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304721 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534708 true] [17592186304721 1111 #uuid "90eebe8d-a1bf-5a93-9fe5-6679ea8bcebf" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304722 1034 "4" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304722 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534708 true] [17592186304722 1111 #uuid "0635812a-7fa1-5e30-8c2a-bc2d9a42e2a5" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304723 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304724 13194139534708 true] [17592186304723 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534708 true] [17592186304723 1041 "field-2" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304723 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304724 13194139534708 true] [17592186304723 1110 #uuid "787cb405-e289-5a06-b049-1dc9f7c5ad39" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304724 1034 "3" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304724 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534708 true] [17592186304724 1111 #uuid "9a4473db-7fee-5b1f-8a26-047e5fd0e3dc" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304725 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304726 13194139534708 true] [17592186304725 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534708 true] [17592186304725 1041 "field-3" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304725 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304726 13194139534708 true] [17592186304725 1110 #uuid "2841aef9-c21a-5455-ae6f-554f7030f20e" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304726 1034 "30" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304726 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534708 true] [17592186304726 1111 #uuid "6c852974-a27c-5abc-be39-2ca651f2d7bf" 