t{i}) & = \\\\ -5(x-3)({x}^{2}+x(2\\text{i})-x(2\\text{i})-(2\\text{i})^{2}) & = \\\\ -5(x-3)({x}^{2}+4) & = \\\\ -5({x}^{3}+4x-3{x}^{2}-12) & = \\\\ -5{x}^{3}+15{x}^{2}-20x+60.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=-5{x}^{3}+15{x}^{2}-20x+60.$" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304730 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304731 13194139534708 true] [17592186304730 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304732 13194139534708 true] [17592186304730 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534708 true] [17592186304730 1041 "field-1" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304730 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304731 13194139534708 true] [17592186304730 1110 #uuid "78cb8ffb-41ec-5e65-9588-6ef2643e0a3f" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304731 1034 "-5" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304731 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534708 true] [17592186304731 1111 #uuid "7193273d-34dc-56fc-a691-019429bdc7ac" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304732 1034 "5" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304732 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534708 true] [17592186304732 1111 #uuid "bf138c3b-e186-5c39-8b74-ee1bbc10e18d" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304733 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304734 13194139534708 true] [17592186304733 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534708 true] [17592186304733 1041 "field-2" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304733 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304734 13194139534708 true] [17592186304733 1110 #uuid "8920c028-f8ad-508f-95a2-bb7c30b5ead7" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304734 1034 "15" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304734 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534708 true] [17592186304734 1111 #uuid "d8dac704-a25a-5713-9310-0fa3fdb91d80" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304735 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304736 13194139534708 true] [17592186304735 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534708 true] [17592186304735 1041 "field-3" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304735 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304736 13194139534708 true] [17592186304735 1110 #uuid "f7843f6e-45f2-5168-8080-8d196290edab" 13194139534708 true] [17592186304736 1034 "20" 13194139534708 true] [175921863